# Local backend refresh

After finishing backend work in **ord-api**, restart the local JVM app:

```bash
# from ord-ops (recommended)
make api-refresh

# or from ord-api
make dev-refresh
```

- **Dev mode** — `spring-boot:run` with tests fully skipped (`-Dmaven.test.skip=true`). Broken tests do not block local runs.
- **DB stays in Docker** — only the Spring Boot process restarts.
- First-time start: `make api-dev` (ord-ops) or `make dev` (ord-api).
- Full Docker stack (slower): `make docker-restart` in ord-api.
